Andrew is referring to the email exchange he and I had. He originally
wanted to be pointed to some texts written in Lojban that were
officially approved as correct examples from which to learn. One of my
responses to this request was that the Logical Language Group
officially approves textbooks and other materials, but does not
provide official approvals on canonical texts written in Lojban about
something other than how to learn Lojban.

